## 🔧 Useful Docker Commands (Reference)

| Command | What it does |
|---------|-------------|
| `docker ps` | Show running containers |
| `docker ps -a` | Show all containers (including stopped) |
| `docker logs insurance-portal` | View app logs |
| `docker logs -f insurance-portal` | Live/follow logs |
| `docker stop insurance-portal` | Stop the container |
| `docker start insurance-portal` | Start a stopped container |
| `docker restart insurance-portal` | Restart the container |
| `docker rm insurance-portal` | Delete the container |
| `docker images` | List all Docker images |

