## 🔄 How to Update Your App (After Code Changes)

Whenever you make code changes, follow these steps:

**On your Windows PC:**
```bash
# 1. Build new image
docker build -t insurance-portal:latest .

# 2. Push to Docker Hub
docker push yourdockerhubusername/insurance-portal:latest
```

**On your EC2 server:**
```bash
# 1. Pull the new image
docker pull yourdockerhubusername/insurance-portal:latest

# 2. Stop and remove old container
docker stop insurance-portal
docker rm insurance-portal

# 3. Start new container
docker run -d \
  -p 9191:9191 \
  --name insurance-portal \
  --restart always \
  yourdockerhubusername/insurance-portal:latest
```

